{"id": "68461", "title": "一追到底", "author": "翩章", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 21, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68461.htm", "intro": "俗话说，男追女隔座山，女追男隔层纱。\r\n可尹瑟要嫁陆以泽，隔的却是层金刚砂！\r\n\r\n注：这是一篇别扭女倒追腹黑男，反被顺利拿下的现言小文。\r\n\r\n[关于本文][1v1][宠文][双CP]\r\n[更新时间][21:00后][除周末]\r\n\r\n[有爱的小剧场]\r\n清晨，尹瑟看向身旁假寐着的陆以泽。\r\n尹（-﹃-）：“你看起来就像一尊艺术品。”\r\n陆（-﹃-）：“艺术品的夫人，你荣幸不？”", "base": "files/article/html/68/68461", "chapters": [{"title": "Chapter 01", "file": "10530389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 02", "file": "10530390.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 03", "file": "10530391.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 04", "file": "10530392.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 05", "file": "10530393.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 06", "file": "10530394.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 07", "file": "10530395.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 08", "file": "10530396.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 09", "file": "10530397.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 10", "file": "10530398.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 11", "file": "10530399.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 12", "file": "10530400.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 13", "file": "10530401.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 14", "file": "10530402.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 15", "file": "10530403.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10530404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10530405.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10530406.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10530407.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40完结", "file": "10530408.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "10530409.html", "available": false}]}